**Source**: Open3D project via AnatomyTOOL create page  
**License**: CC BY-SA 4.0  
**Usage**: Dorsal interossei, proximal arteries, ankle/foot ligaments/retinacula/fascia, Day 4x–4z fine/cutaneous/calcaneal/dorsal-digital nerve meshes, Day 4aa fine vessels (deep plantar a./arch, grouped dorsal MTA, medial plantar branches), and Day 4ab tarsal/calcaneal/perforator vessels under `public/models/right-foot/by-sa/` (Kabsch-aligned). See that directory's NOTICE.md.

